acceptance_criteria: An exported destructuring pattern with no doc comment is reported as a violation naming the pattern; an exported statement with several declarators is judged; neither change introduces a false positive on a documented export
parent: ops-073p
resolution: Implemented fail-closed multi-binding and destructuring evaluation with focused regression tests.
expected_result: Every exported binding is evaluated without false positives on documented multi-declarator or destructuring exports.
actual_result: "The lexer now walks every top-level declarator, names destructuring patterns, and the negative controls pass."
